{
  "id": 1164,
  "name": "fossilized-fish",
  "fling_power": 100,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "dex-completion",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/35/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おおむかし　うみに　すんでいた\nこだい　ポケモンの　カセキの　いちぶ。\nどんな　すがた　だったのかは　なぞ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "오랜 옛날 바다에 살았던\n고대 포켓몬 화석의 일부.\n어떤 모습이었는지는 수수께끼다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "很久以前棲息在海裡的\n古代寶可夢的化石碎片。\n本來面目至今仍是個謎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un morceau du fossile d’un ancien Pokémon aquatique.\nNul ne sait à quoi il ressemblait.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Teilstück des Fossils eines urzeitlichen Pokémon,\ndas in grauer Vorzeit im Meer lebte. Wie es zu\nLebzeiten aussah, ist ein Rätsel.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parte del fósil de un Pokémon prehistórico que habitaba\nen el mar. Su apariencia sigue siendo una incógnita.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parte del fossile di un Pokémon preistorico che viveva\nin mare. Nessuno sa quale fosse il suo aspetto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The fossil of an ancient Pokémon that once lived in the\nsea. What it looked like is a mystery.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大昔　海に　すんでいた\n古代　ポケモンの　カセキの一部。\nどんな　姿　だったのかは　謎。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "远古时代的宝可梦化石残片。\n它曾栖息于大海，\n本来面目至今仍是未解之谜。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Parte del fósil de un Pokémon prehistórico que habitaba\nen el mar. Su apariencia sigue siendo una incógnita.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
  ],
